117434.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-18T12:36:16Z"},"body":"Different approach from #114457 (cc @kbieganski)\r\n\r\nCloses #111175 (cannot reproduce myself, but has received feedback from @tmilker & @rsa17826\r\n it works)\r\n\r\nInstead of the original solution of always propagating the `stopped` signal even when no debugger session was active (breaks DAP since it expects the signal to be emitted once and when a session is active), this approach does so only if the debug server is valid or the debugger session is active. If neither of those happen, then we still stop the debugging session but \"internally\", without propagating the `stopped` signal.\r\n\r\n(cc @m4gr3d due to f713a20c94478bef3a8bc0e9300c24d37987b984 / #108518, just to double check this doesn't reintroduce an issue you fixed)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117434/